# MongoDB Atlas Configuration
# 1. Go to https://www.mongodb.com/cloud/atlas
# 2. Create/Sign in to your account
# 3. Create a new cluster
# 4. Click "Connect" and choose "Connect your application"
# 5. Copy the connection string and replace <password> with your database password
# 6. Replace <username> with your database username
# Example: mongodb+srv://username:password@cluster0.xxxxx.mongodb.net/partymix?retryWrites=true&w=majority
MONGODB_URI=mongodb+srv://username:password@your-cluster.mongodb.net/partymix?retryWrites=true&w=majority

PORT=3001
NODE_ENV=development

# Admin panel (/admin)
ADMIN_PASSWORD=change-me
JWT_SECRET=change-me-to-a-long-random-secret

# AI generation (optional; required for live Groq responses)
GROQ_API_KEY=
GROQ_MODEL=llama-3.1-8b-instant
GROQ_EMBED_MODEL=nomic-embed-text-v1.5

# Produção (Render):
# - CORS_ORIGINS = origem exacta do frontend Netlify, sem wildcard (ex.: https://partymix.netlify.app)
# - ADMIN_PASSWORD >= 12 caracteres, sem "change-me"
# - JWT_SECRET >= 32 caracteres aleatórios
# - MONGODB_URI com password actual. Se esta URI alguma vez esteve no git, roda a password no Atlas imediatamente.
# - Atlas: activa backups contínuos (PITR) no cluster. A app não faz backup.
# - GROQ_API_KEY só no servidor; limite actual 8 req/min e 80/dia por IP.

# Fase 2 — uma instância sticky (obrigatório)
# WEB_CONCURRENCY=1
# INSTANCE_ID=partymix-1
# ROOM_HASH_SALT=random-not-the-room-code
# SENTRY_DSN=   # opcional; instala @sentry/node no servidor se usares
# FEATURE_CARDS_ONLINE=1
# FEATURE_ALDEIA_ONLINE=1
# FEATURE_MEMEMIX_ONLINE=1
# FEATURE_MW_ONLINE=1

# Fase 3 — legal / UGC
# PUBLIC_ORIGIN=https://teu-dominio.example
# (HTTPS obrigatório; aparece em /privacy, /terms e GET /api/features)

# Fase 4 — Play Store / TWA
# PLAY_PACKAGE_ID=pt.partymix.app
# PLAY_SHA256_CERT=AA:BB:CC:...   # SHA-256 da assinatura Play (32 pares). Sem isto play.ready=false.
# Depois: node scripts/write-play-files.js  e publica /.well-known/assetlinks.json no frontend.

